{"vid": "Dd7FixvoKBw", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash+cn:deepseek-v4.1-flash+global:deepseek-v4.1-flash-sg", "source": "Dd7FixvoKBw.en.vtt", "cues": [{"s": 2.34, "e": 4.07, "zh": "好了，都听好了。", "en": "- ALL RIGHT, LISTEN UP, Y'ALL."}, {"s": 4.1, "e": 7.04, "zh": "我是你们的代课老师，Garvey 老师。", "en": "I'M Y'ALL'S SUBSTITUTE TEACHER, MR. GARVEY."}, {"s": 7.07, "e": 10.68, "zh": "我在市中心教了20年书，", "en": "I TAUGHT SCHOOL FOR 20 YEARS IN THE INNER CITY,"}, {"s": 10.71, "e": 13.11, "zh": "所以别想跟我耍花样。", "en": "SO DON'T EVEN THINK ABOUT MESSING WITH ME."}, {"s": 13.15, "e": 15.41, "zh": "听懂了吗？——嗯哼。", "en": "Y'ALL FEEL ME? - MM-HMM."}, {"s": 15.45, "e": 18.95, "zh": "好，我们来点名。", "en": "- OKAY. LET'S TAKE ROLL HERE."}, {"s": 18.99, "e": 22.89, "zh": "Jay Quellin。", "en": "JAY QUELLIN."}, {"s": 22.92, "e": 24.46, "zh": "Jay Quellin 在哪？", "en": "WHERE'S JAY QUELLIN AT?"}, {"s": 24.49, "e": 27.83, "zh": "这儿没有 Jay Quellin？", "en": "NO JAY QUELLIN HERE?"}, {"s": 27.86, "e": 29.3, "zh": "——[清嗓子]——在。", "en": "- [clears throat] - YEAH."}, {"s": 29.33, "e": 31.93, "zh": "——呃，你是说 Jacqueline 吗？", "en": "- UH, DO YOU MEAN JACQUELINE?"}, {"s": 31.96, "e": 34.97, "zh": "——行吧，那就这么玩是吧。", "en": "- OKAY. SO THAT'S HOW IT'S GONNA BE."}, {"s": 35.0, "e": 36.37, "zh": "你们想玩。", "en": "Y'ALL WANNA PLAY."}, {"s": 36.4, "e": 38.51, "zh": "那好。", "en": "OKAY, THEN."}, {"s": 38.54, "e": 41.21, "zh": "我盯上你了，Jay Quellin。", "en": "I GOT MY EYE ON YOU, JAY QUELLIN."}, {"s": 44.48, "e": 46.71, "zh": "Balakay。", "en": "BALAKAY."}, {"s": 46.75, "e": 49.75, "zh": "Balakay 在哪？", "en": "WHERE IS BALAKAY AT?"}, {"s": 49.78, "e": 53.69, "zh": "今天这儿没有 Balakay？", "en": "THERE'S NO BALAKAY HERE TODAY?"}, {"s": 53.72, "e": 54.69, "zh": "在，老师。", "en": "YES, SIR."}, {"s": 54.72, "e": 58.06, "zh": "——我叫 Blake。——Bl……", "en": "- MY NAME IS BLAKE. - BL..."}, {"s": 58.09, "e": 60.49, "zh": "你他妈脑子进水了吗？", "en": "ARE YOU OUT OF YOUR GODDAMN MIND?"}, {"s": 60.53, "e": 63.16, "zh": "[模仿语气] Blake。什么鬼？", "en": "[mocking voice] BLAKE. WHAT?"}, {"s": 63.2, "e": 65.06, "zh": "你想开战吗，Balakay？——不想。", "en": "DO YOU WANNA GO TO WAR, BALAKEY? - NO."}, {"s": 65.1, "e": 66.8, "zh": "——因为我们可以开战。——不想。", "en": "- 'CAUSE WE COULD GO TO WAR. - NO."}, {"s": 66.83, "e": 70.4, "zh": "——我说真的。我说真的。", "en": "- I'M FOR REAL. I'M FOR REAL."}, {"s": 70.44, "e": 74.67, "zh": "所以你最好收敛点。", "en": "SO YOU BETTER CHECK YOURSELF."}, {"s": 74.71, "e": 77.54, "zh": "DEE-NICE。", "en": "DEE-NICE."}, {"s": 77.58, "e": 81.38, "zh": "有没有一个叫DEE-NICE的？", "en": "IS THERE A DEE-NICE?"}, {"s": 81.42, "e": 85.75, "zh": "你们谁要是敢说个什么蠢名字……", "en": "IF ONE OF Y'ALL SAYS SOME SILLY-ASS NAME..."}, {"s": 85.79, "e": 89.72, "zh": "全班都得承受我的怒火。", "en": "THIS WHOLE CLASS IS GONNA FEEL MY WRATH."}, {"s": 89.76, "e": 92.53, "zh": "好了，DEE-NICE。——你是说Denise吗？", "en": "NOW, DEE-NICE. - DO YOU MEAN DENISE?"}, {"s": 92.56, "e": 95.86, "zh": "——狗娘养的！", "en": "- SON OF A BITCH!"}, {"s": 95.9, "e": 97.86, "zh": "你现在就把你的名字念对。", "en": "YOU SAY YOUR NAME RIGHT, RIGHT NOW."}, {"s": 97.9, "e": 99.0, "zh": "——Denise？——念对。", "en": "- DENISE? - YOU SAY IT RIGHT."}, {"s": 99.1, "e": 100.1, "zh": "——Denise。——念对。", "en": "- DENISE. - CORRECTLY."}, {"s": 100.1, "e": 101.1, "zh": "——Denise。——对。", "en": "- DENISE. - RIGHT."}, {"s": 101.1, "e": 102.1, "zh": "——Denise。——对。", "en": "- DENISE. - RIGHT."}, {"s": 102.14, "e": 103.34, "zh": "——DEE-NICE。——好多了。", "en": "- DEE-NICE. - THAT'S BETTER."}, {"s": 103.37, "e": 104.47, "zh": "——[叹气]——谢谢。", "en": "- [sighs] - THANK YOU."}, {"s": 104.5, "e": 108.11, "zh": "现在，AY-AY-RON。", "en": "NOW, AY-AY-RON."}, {"s": 108.11, "e": 109.91, "zh": "你在哪？", "en": "WHERE ARE YOU?"}, {"s": 109.94, "e": 113.18, "zh": "AY-AY-RON现在在哪？", "en": "WHERE IS AY-AY-RON RIGHT NOW?"}, {"s": 113.21, "e": 115.11, "zh": "没有AY-AY-RON，是吧？", "en": "NO AY-AY RON, HUH?"}, {"s": 115.11, "e": 119.95, "zh": "那你最好是病了、死了，或者哑了，AY-AY-RON！", "en": "WELL, YOU BETTER BE SICK, DEAD, OR MUTE, AY-AY-RON!"}, {"s": 120.05, "e": 123.56, "zh": "——到。哦，天哪。", "en": "- HERE. OH, MAN."}, {"s": 123.59, "e": 125.39, "zh": "——我第一次叫你的时候你怎么不答应，啊？", "en": "- WHY DIDN'T YOU ANSWER ME THE FIRST TIME I SAID IT, HUH?"}, {"s": 125.42, "e": 126.86, "zh": "——啊？——你知道，我就是问问你。", "en": "- HUH? - YOU KNOW, I'M JUST ASKING YOU."}, {"s": 126.89, "e": 128.5, "zh": "我说了大概四遍。", "en": "I SAID IT, LIKE, FOUR TIMES."}, {"s": 128.53, "e": 132.37, "zh": "那为什么我第一次说“AY-AY-RON”的时候你不答应？", "en": "SO WHY DIDN'T YOU SAY IT THE FIRST TIME I SAID, \"AY-AY-RON?\""}, {"s": 135.07, "e": 136.57, "zh": "——因为它的发音是“Aaron”。", "en": "- BECAUSE IT'S PRONOUNCED \"AARON.\""}, {"s": 136.6, "e": 140.47, "zh": "——狗娘养的！[哗啦声]", "en": "- SON OF A BITCH! [clattering]"}, {"s": 140.51, "e": 143.44, "zh": "你完蛋了，AY-AY-RON，现在赶紧滚", "en": "YOU DONE MESSED UP, AY-AY RON, NOW TAKE YOUR ASS ON DOWN"}, {"s": 143.48, "e": 145.61, "zh": "到OH-SHAG-HENNESY的办公室去，现在就告诉他", "en": "TO OH-SHAG-HENNESY'S OFFICE RIGHT NOW AND TELL HIM"}, {"s": 145.65, "e": 148.38, "zh": "你到底干了什么！", "en": "EXACTLY WHAT YOU DID!"}, {"s": 148.41, "e": 152.22, "zh": "- 谁？ - 奥沙格-亨尼西！", "en": "- WHO? - OH-SHAG-HENNESY!"}, {"s": 152.25, "e": 153.35, "zh": "- 奥肖内西校长？", "en": "- PRINCIPAL O'SHAUGHNESSY?"}, {"s": 153.39, "e": 155.96, "zh": "- 滚出我的教室，不然我打断", "en": "- GET OUT OF MY GODDAMN CLASSROOM BEFORE I BREAK"}, {"s": 155.99, "e": 157.52, "zh": "你的腿塞你屁股里！", "en": "MY FOOT OFF IN YOUR ASS!"}, {"s": 157.56, "e": 159.86, "zh": "不服从管教……", "en": "INSUBORDINATE..."}, {"s": 159.89, "e": 162.93, "zh": "还粗鲁无礼。", "en": "AND CHURLISH."}, {"s": 166.5, "e": 168.4, "zh": "蒂莫西。", "en": "TYM-OH-THEE."}, {"s": 168.44, "e": 170.37, "zh": "- 到。 - 谢谢！", "en": "- PRESENT. - THANK YOU!"}]}